  "shortName": null,
  "description": "Furtastic is Denmark's first furry convention, first held July 8 to 10, 2011. It is a small convention with an attendee limit of 80 including staff, meant to let people meet each other thoroughly and make friendships that last beyond the weekend. Alcohol is sold, as part of Danish culture. Early editions were held in a scout hut outside Aalborg, then at the camp of Olufsborg in Hundslund, and as of 2022 in a scout hut near the beach in Gjerrild on Djursland, surrounded by forest and fields, with a small outdoor fireplace as the evening's meeting point.",
